  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maps and Statistics for Sustainable Goals in Kyrgyzstan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional project-cooperation on statistics and maps between Kyrgyz and Norwegian government agencies. The project will address several aspects of the SDG agenda and the planned impact is; Improved evidence based planning for optimal resource allocation and improved welfare across the Kyrgyz society, and main expected outcomes; Maps available for statistics and other usage in private and public sectors, Statistics better adapted to user needs. Partners: SSB, Kartverket, NSC and SRS.</narrative>
  </description>
